1
00:00:44,119 --> 00:00:45,679
As long as we get that USB drive

2
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,280
you and Xie Guanhong will both be safe

3
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,840
Then go get it

4
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,600
Go get it

5
00:00:51,719 --> 00:00:53,200
The whole building's sealed off right now

6
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,159
How am I supposed to get it?

7
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,479
You know as well as I do

8
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,520
I've got my people in there

9
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,079
Just walk right in

10
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,359
find your USB drive

11
00:01:00,679 --> 00:01:01,679
and bring it out

12
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,920
You don't even trust me

13
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:51,360
You really think I couldn't find you?

14
00:02:57,199 --> 00:02:59,400
As long as you're willing to rally the troops

15
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,199
This is all between you brothers

16
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,439
We can settle it behind closed doors

17
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:06,759
You can work it out yourselves, right?

18
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:12,240
Our side's in no hurry

19
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:16,039
But is that Tung Hing crowd in a hurry?

20
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,479
I wouldn't know.

21
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,199
Talk.

22
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,080
Xie Guanhong and Xie Zihao,

23
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,479
the 48 hours are almost up.

24
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,919
Can we let them go now?

25
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:41,159
Let them go?

26
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,319
No way we're letting them go.

27
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:42,960
Not happening.

28
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,919
The higher-ups just called and said

29
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,400
the media's already asking questions.

30
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:48,280
Holding them any longer looks bad.

31
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,000
Do you have any idea?

32
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,039
I'm waiting for the Independent Commission

33
00:03:50,039 --> 00:03:51,039
Against Corruption to call.

34
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,800
Then I can arrest him for good.

35
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,439
Let him go? How can I?

36
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:54,120
You tell me.

37
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:54,759
Yes, sir.

38
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:55,960
I understand, Officer Chen.

39
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:58,560
But the brothers are hitting their limit.

40
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,360
Xie Guanhong's wife, Zheng Baojiao,

41
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:02,120
has been at the station since morning.

42
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:04,159
She's already started making a scene.

43
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,639
Right.

44
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,039
No problem.

45
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,199
Do everything by the book.

46
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:13,840
Yes, sir.

47
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:25,720
Where's my son?

48
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,160
We're from the same hometown, after all.

49
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:27,920
Kept you here a few minutes.

50
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,040
Are you unhappy about something?

51
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:30,839
Where's my son?

52
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,360
This shirt is expensive, you know.

53
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:33,720
He was just released.

54
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,800
Sign it.

55
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:49,160
Last night Uncle Fat went to see A Qiang.

56
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:58,399
Dad.

57
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,120
Zihao.

58
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,759
Zihao.

59
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,120
Mom.

60
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,160
Let Mom take a look at you.

61
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,120
Oh, my God.

62
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,079
They didn't do anything to you, did they?

63
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,680
No.

64
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,480
Did they hit you?

65
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,839
What happened?

66
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:39,879
Oh, my God.

67
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:41,480
Did they let you eat properly?

68
00:05:45,879 --> 00:05:48,040
Well, I'm getting in the car now.

69
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,079
Xie Guanhong

70
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,519
Fei, head back to the office.

71
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:40,600
No need.

72
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,560
I've got the stuff right here.

73
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,240
You had him help you?

74
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:50,759
What else did you expect?

75
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,839
Hand it over.

76
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:20,120
Xie Guanhong, your time is up!

77
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,519
This is for Boss Camel!

78
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:23,519
Xie Guanhong, your time is up!

79
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:25,240
This is for Boss Camel!

80
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:54,600
Go!

81
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,040
Hurry, move!

82
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,720
Faster!

83
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,720
Xie Guanhong!

84
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,560
Still the same as ever.

85
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,360
Move it!

86
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,960
Freeze!

87
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:00,919
Ah Hong.

88
00:09:01,759 --> 00:09:03,279
Take A Jiao and Zihao out of Harbor City.

89
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,120
Lie low somewhere for a while.

90
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:07,279
Once I'm gone,

91
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,240
Heyisheng will be dragons without a head.

92
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:14,720
The organization will manage somehow.

93
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,639
I get it now.

94
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:24,120
Thought you'd stay out of gang affairs?

95
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:25,840
Live a normal, quiet life?

96
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:27,879
So what,

97
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,320
you changed your mind?

98
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,919
Want to be Dragon Head?

99
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:41,080
Pretending to turn down Uncle Fat,

100
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,320
while tailing me, watching my every move.

101
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,519
Liang Zhiqiang.

102
00:09:48,919 --> 00:09:50,720
Figure out what the hell you actually want.

103
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:54,600
I just don't want to see you die.

104
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,480
Let me ask you.

105
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,960
Did you kill Cannon?

106
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,000
I didn't.

107
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,240
The cops say he killed himself,

108
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,240
and you come asking me?

109
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:10,799
You believe that fat bastard,

110
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,200
but not your own brother?

111
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,320
I never said I didn't believe you.

112
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,600
I just wanted to hear it from you.

113
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,159
Ah Hong.

114
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,320
Are you even the same Ah Hong anymore?

115
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,759
Betraying brothers in the organization.

116
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,519
That's what you call treachery.

117
00:10:38,519 --> 00:10:39,600
Treachery, my ass.

118
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,240
I told you I didn't kill Cannon.

119
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,039
Do you believe me?

120
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:43,600
You believe the cops.

121
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,360
You believe Cannon.

122
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,720
The one person you don't believe is me.

123
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,679
Just because of some so-called rules,

124
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:49,960
I'm supposed to give up everything I built,

125
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,679
and just walk away from here?

126
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:56,440
I held Heyisheng together all these years.

127
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:57,279
Yeah.

128
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:59,120
You've changed.

129
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,080
Now all you think about is profit.

130
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,879
Sure, you held the organization together.

131
00:11:02,879 --> 00:11:03,600
But what about the brothers?

132
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,200
They're all dead.

133
00:11:04,799 --> 00:11:05,919
Oh, for those brothers, huh?

134
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,600
Liang Zhiqiang.

135
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:08,000
Such a saint, a real Jesus.

136
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:10,879
It's been 20 years. Times have changed.

137
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,279
So I'm not loyal.

138
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:13,720
Nobody in this world is loyal anymore.

139
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,159
You think you're loyal?

140
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,919
Go tell it to Brother Long down below.

141
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,879
The nerve to bring up Brother Long?

142
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:19,879
Who was it I saved back then?

143
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:21,159
Who did I wait over 20 years out here for?

144
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:22,240
While you were inside on vacation.

145
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:22,759
You've forgotten who you even are.

146
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:23,399
I've been through hell!

147
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,120
I had no choice.

148
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:24,960
Now you say you had no choice,

149
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:25,759
no other option.

150
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,519
Is that my fault?

151
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:27,960
Don't you get it? There's always a choice.

152
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,799
Want to be Dragon Head? Just tell me!

153
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:30,159
You only trust yourself.

154
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,759
You're just too damn stubborn to admit it.

155
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,159
Both of you, shut the hell up!

156
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:34,120
How is any of this your business?

157
00:11:36,639 --> 00:11:37,240
Fine.

158
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,679
It's none of my business.

159
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,279
None of my business if you die out there.

160
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:41,799
But you two,

161
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:44,159
are you going to drag Zihao down with you?

162
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,240
Let me tell you,

163
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,840
I'm taking Zihao out of Harbor City.

164
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,399
What a great brother.

165
00:11:56,399 --> 00:11:57,360
Liang Zhiqiang.

166
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:58,519
What did you say?

167
00:12:02,879 --> 00:12:04,679
This isn't a discussion.

168
00:12:04,919 --> 00:12:06,200
I'm telling you how it's going to be.

169
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,360
You're the public enemy now.

170
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,240
This is the road you chose for yourself.

171
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:13,360
I won't let anything happen to my son.

172
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,960
Liang Zhiqiang! Liang Zhiqiang!

173
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,240
Are you all right?

174
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,360
You're hurt.

175
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:22,960
It's nothing.

176
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,840
Just a little scratch.

177
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,000
Are you crazy?

178
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,399
A grown man, still getting into fights.

179
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,559
If something really happened to you, I...

180
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:52,000
Wait for me.

181
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:57,840
What, are you jealous?
